comments[23]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T21:34:36.710Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-07-31: release automation now installs the exact registry version into unrelated npm and Bun roots, asserts executable containment, and runs a ten-step cold agent lifecycle covering init, orient, create, claim, annotate, evidence linking, close, validate, and context with per-step output bounds and aggregate token cost. Failure reports name the manager and step; unit controls cover containment and budget failures. Live 2026.7.31 acceptance passed for both managers: 10 steps each, 19,568 characters and 4,892 estimated tokens. This item remains active because the hosted OS matrix and previous-release control session are not yet implemented."
  "2026-07-31T21:51:09.098Z","harness:codex","CI portability evidence 2026-07-31: Windows exposed that the installed-agent escape negative control recognized only POSIX node_modules/.bin separators. The fixture now uses node:path separators and derives an outside path on the current drive, preserving the same containment assertion on Windows and POSIX. The focused 8-test verifier suite passes, ESLint passes, and the full 6,623-test coverage run remains exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-07-31T22:25:41.756Z","harness:codex","Review-loop release evidence 2026-07-31: registry installs now retry transient failures three times with bounded production backoff, Bun disables lifecycle scripts, synchronous subprocesses enforce timeout/input invariants, pm-mcp initialize has a 60-second deadline, and missing executable coverage fails before any registry execution. Negative controls and exact cross-platform tests pass; the complete 6,625-test suite is 100/100/100/100 and quality:static is green. Hosted OS-matrix and previous-release control acceptance remain open."
  "2026-08-03T11:17:40.251Z","harness:codex","Partial acceptance evidence 2026-08-03: scripts/release/verify-published-release.mjs passed against exact version 2026.8.3 for registry integrity, npx and bunx real command dispatch, both executor MCP handshakes, bin coverage, missing-command negative controls, and GitHub Release metadata. The item remains open because its broader clean-install scripted agent-session and advertisement-order contract was not re-proved by this command alone."
  "2026-08-09T16:21:34.768Z","harness:codex","Published 2026.8.9 acceptance evidence: both npm and Bun clean installs completed init, orient, create, claim, annotate, link evidence, close, validate, read-back, and context-read-back within their output ceilings. The report returned ok:true for both managers, but final temp-root removal raised ENOTEMPTY and made the wrapper exit 1; cleanup ownership is canonical pm-p5u6, so this item remains open for its existing OS-matrix and previous-release residuals."
  "2026-08-15T01:33:29.338Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence 2026-08-15: the local packed-artifact release gate hung for more than 11 minutes inside npm exec despite a valid tarball. Local-tarball npx/npm execution is now explicitly offline and every subprocess has a 120-second timeout. The 24-test smoke suite passes, including a new negative-control contract that every relevant subprocess is offline and all subprocesses are bounded; the real packed smoke completes in about 15 seconds with version 2026.8.14 and 13 packages. The broader hosted OS-matrix and previous-release residuals remain open on this canonical item."
  "2026-08-15T02:58:00.044Z","harness:codex","PR #1016 CI correction 2026-08-15: --offline was valid only on a warmed local npm cache and failed a clean GitHub runner with ENOTCACHED for @sentry/node. Local-tarball npm/npx installs now allow dependency resolution while every subprocess retains the 120-second deadline. The 24-test smoke suite, real packed tarball smoke (2026.8.14, 13 packages), typecheck, and exact 7,337-test 100/100/100/100 coverage pass. Hosted OS-matrix and previous-release residuals remain open."
  "2026-08-15T03:01:46.864Z","harness:codex","Pause evidence: the PR smoke correction and linked acceptance tests are complete (64/64 across two links), but the broader released-artifact OS matrix and previous-release acceptance residuals remain open for future active work."
  "2026-08-25T05:19:28.684Z","harness:codex","Roadmap integration: MCP 2026-07-28 conformance now explicitly requires packed, npm, npx, and bunx consumers to execute the canonical agent journey and verify advertised version, discovery, MRTR, tasks, subscriptions, authorization, caching, and removal policy before release."
  "2026-08-27T09:41:01.225Z","harness:codex","Production evidence 2026-08-27: Auto Release run 33056579019 atomically pushed v2026.8.27 at f5298d7ceff57afeb9142de759f763ed4d80627e and downstream Release run 33057919223 published @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.8.27 with npm provenance. Exact npm, npx, bunx, pm/pm-cli/MCP/MCP-HTTP and negative-control verification returned ok:true, then the workflow-wide timeout-minutes:20 canceled the job immediately before installed npm/Bun agent-session acceptance and GitHub Release creation. Scope: make the hosted timeout budget cover the declared acceptance stages, add a contract/negative control, review and merge, then dispatch idempotent exact-tag recovery from main; npm must not be republished. Duplicate search covered all statuses for timeout-minutes, canceled GitHub Release creation, exact-tag recovery, and released-artifact acceptance; pm-ygli86 is the canonical owner."
  "2026-08-27T10:03:01.186Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence (2026-08-27): production Auto Release run 33056579019 published immutable v2026.8.27/npm 2026.8.27, but downstream Release run 33057919223 was canceled by the 20-minute workflow timeout immediately after exact-artifact npm/npx/bunx verification, before installed-agent acceptance and GitHub Release advertisement. TDD added a parsed-workflow contract that failed at 20 minutes, then raised Release to 45 minutes and its serial Auto Release parent to 90 minutes with a required 30-minute parent margin. Verification: linked tests 70/70; full suite 585 files and 8,042 tests; exact coverage 100/100/100/100; pnpm lint, typecheck, docs-link gate, secret scan, and pnpm audit --audit-level=high all pass with zero duplicate code and no known vulnerabilities. Manual clean temporary installs of @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.8.27 through npm and Bun each completed all 11 scripted agent-session steps. The broader hosted-OS/previous-release residuals remain open; this claim covers only the actively delivered timeout recovery."
  "2026-08-27T10:13:48.434Z","harness:codex","PR #1129 review evidence: CodeRabbit correctly identified that .github/workflows/auto-release.yml was changed but absent from this item's file manifest. Added the link through pm files (no direct tracker edits) with explicit serial-parent timeout scope. The focused parsed-workflow timeout contract passes 1/1 after the metadata-only correction."
  "2026-09-12T21:08:42.093Z","harness:codex","GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1247. Canonical tracking reused after complete all-status duplicate check."
  "2026-09-16T11:43:14.066Z","harness:codex","Connected delivery with pm-rcjyft: add cross-platform packed first-run acceptance driven by documented commands and installed binaries. GitHub issues 1246, 1247, 1248 already link canonical tracker owners; no open PRs or Dependabot alerts on 2026-09-16. Scheduled Auto Release run 35070734120 succeeded. Full all-status inventory contains 2762 items, complete source with no unreadable records."
  "2026-09-16T11:53:05.947Z","harness:codex","Live complete-context census: full all-status CLI export returned all 2762 items with no omissions and no unreadable sources: 2439 closed, 248 open, 59 draft, 14 canceled, and only the two active delivery items in progress. Rich context includes 13616 comments, 1424 notes, 1073 learnings, 13869 file links, 2998 doc links and 4498 tests. Existing graph has 2905 implements, 937 discovered_from, 539 verifies and 104 recurs_from edges alongside associative links; added verifies edge to the launcher work based on shared packed acceptance rather than manufacturing graph depth. Live code-scanning and secret-scanning APIs returned no open alerts; pnpm audit reports no known vulnerabilities."
  "2026-09-16T11:55:37.071Z","harness:codex","Manual acceptance: built tarball installed globally into a fresh temporary prefix; installed pm reports 2026.9.16. Actual README init/create/list succeeded with 597/53/169 output characters, and the installed MCP handshake advertised 2026.9.16. CI now runs the same tarball on Ubuntu/macOS/Windows at Node 22.18.0 and 24. Extended the harness to merge two branches carrying distinct comments and verify reconciled immutable history."
  "2026-09-16T12:08:20.772Z","harness:codex","Cross-platform implementation detail: npm prefix remains a native path; Git Bash PATH entries on Windows are converted through cygpath before invoking the installed shim. The new matrix is registered under the non-bypassable package-consumer gate. Packed acceptance adds real divergent comment merges and strict history verification; registry OS-matrix and previous-release comparison remain distinct residual acceptance requirements."
  "2026-09-16T12:12:05.382Z","harness:codex","Expanded GitHub #1247 acceptance: isolated HOME/USERPROFILE plus npm prefix/cache; real detached telemetry worker posts to a loopback collector and leaves an empty physical queue with successful delivery timestamp. Four harness tests pass, with malformed README negative controls and actual CLI/MCP/history/telemetry execution. The same 11-step registry agent harness passed npm and Bun for both 2026.9.16 and previous 2026.9.15, each 5290 estimated output tokens. This is live manual previous-release comparison; automated registry platform matrix remains a separate residual."
  "2026-09-16T12:19:32.774Z","harness:codex","Historical context cross-check: live pm-e9zh is closed with a completed evidence-recovery pass (622 source-grounded fields on 285 records). Its explicit unrecoverable residual is exactly the 170 records still reported by current validation; do not reopen this completed work or fabricate missing outcomes. The two active items pass independent strict history verification after the concurrent broad scan reported transient current-item mismatches."
  "2026-09-16T12:25:17.299Z","harness:codex","Verification: complete 8897-test suite passes exact 100/100/100/100. All three linked test commands pass. Fresh global tarball install reports 2026.9.16 and README output is bounded at 489/53/169 characters for init/create/list; real merged history, installed MCP, and detached telemetry each pass. Package-first dogfood and packed npx/bunx smoke pass. Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.16 installed through pm package for package-owned changelog generation."
  "2026-09-16T12:43:58.070Z","harness:codex","PR #1261 first settled round: all existing checks passed; six new packed consumers failed because npm interpreted packed/file.tgz as GitHub shorthand. Added a real npm fixture-tarball install using the workflow command; it reproduced the failure before the fix. Changed the spec to ./packed/*.tgz. GitHub main protection now preserves all prior checks and strictness while requiring all six packed first-run contexts (26 required checks total). Sourcery reviewed without actionable findings; CodeRabbit requires an explicit trigger, which will accompany the corrective push. All bot artifacts in the settled inventory were read and rated; no inline finding existed to answer."
  "2026-09-16T13:02:44.810Z","harness:codex","PR #1261 second settled round: Linux and macOS packed consumers pass; Windows consumers expose MCP cleanup before child close (EBUSY). The regression test fails before the fix; cleanup now awaits process closure before deleting its cwd. The workflow fixture now queries npm root --global and asserts sandbox containment instead of guessing the install layout. CodeRabbit completed full review without inline findings, with documentation and scope notes. The build-serialization follow-up was discovered during this actual packed acceptance; managed pm-changelog 2026.9.16 is required for the requested package-owned changelog, so both records remain intentional delivery evidence."
  "2026-09-16T13:06:46.678Z","harness:codex","Revision verification: 18 focused tests pass, including a failing-before-fix process-close ordering control and the real installed CLI/MCP/merge/telemetry session. Linked MCP tests and typecheck/ESLint pass. Full coverage is rerunning without rebuilding dist concurrently. Greptile CLI returned skipped=true with free review quota exhausted; this is unavailable review, not approval. The GitHub request remains subject to the final current-head inventory."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T10:48:39.250Z","harness:claude-code","Measured 2026-07-26 against the published 2026.7.26: post-publish verification covers execution only. verify-published-release.mjs runs npx --yes <pkg> --version, npx --yes --package <pkg> -- pm --version, and bunx --bun <pkg> pm --version. No install path is exercised for any manager — not npm install -g, not a project install, not bun add, not pnpm add — so packaging omissions and binary-link defects reach users through a green pipeline. Confirmed working by hand and therefore available as a starting fixture: bun add @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.7.26 links pm, pm-cli, and pm-mcp, and pm init, pm create, and pm list all succeed under the Bun runtime. The third check's invocation shape is separately defective and is owned by pm-lpqln4."
